{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Mediterranean Mixed Berries Tart",
  "description": "A tangy and molten Mediterranean dish featuring frozen mixed berries, this vegan-friendly tart is perfect for a dessert or snack. It is made with a scallop shell vessel and agemono-deep-fry technique.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
